{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/bae07848b2f68ed11f2279f56f391cdd.avif?t=1760368745\" alt=\"FAR FROM DEAD\" width=1560 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAR FROM DEAD</strong> is a twitchy shoot 'em up boss rush game inspired by run 'n gun classics. Face off against seven challenging bosses, armed with only your trusty handgun and gratuitous i-frames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/974e236aa1def8038d7fff2748a87ed5.poster.avif?t=1760368745\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/974e236aa1def8038d7fff2748a87ed5.webm?t=1760368745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/974e236aa1def8038d7fff2748a87ed5.mp4?t=1760368745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/3a5260ab726e946cbbe026249e02caab.avif?t=1760368745\" alt=\"FEATURES\" width=1560 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SEVEN UNIQUE BOSSES</strong>: Each boss has a distinctive and devastating set of tricks and traps to stop you. Learn their patterns and conquer all seven to earn your victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOB AND WEAVE</strong>: Master the art of dashing through attacks and wall jumping to evade your foes. Then, strike back with your trusty handgun.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/45932036556be4cdec9def4830e0b482.poster.avif?t=1760368745\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/45932036556be4cdec9def4830e0b482.webm?t=1760368745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/45932036556be4cdec9def4830e0b482.mp4?t=1760368745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRY, TRY AGAIN</strong>: While failure is expected, each fight is concise, meaning you'll never be set back too far. Find your flow state and push past the finish line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TOUGH, BUT FAIR</strong>: Need a hand? Use the included Assist Mode to fine-tune the difficulty of your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HANDCRAFTED</strong>: Experience hand-pixeled art and an original chiptune soundtrack.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/d0eaf7be27160a50061dbbbb6d8b48d2.poster.avif?t=1760368745\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/d0eaf7be27160a50061dbbbb6d8b48d2.webm?t=1760368745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1042320/extras/d0eaf7be27160a50061dbbbb6d8b48d2.mp4?t=1760368745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1042320?t=17603